  "_about_connect": "Melomania Connect models: config is the app's LocalConfig per device type (Melomania Connect 2.6.0; the defaults are decoded from its constructor masks: the app shows touch controls, mono and sleep mode unless a model turns them off, and the EQ runs from -9 to +3 dB, a negative step being three times a positive one). The X100 has no LocalConfig entry, so every optional control is off and its EQ is presets only. eq.presets are RemoteConfigDefault.json's per-model presets (the app also reads Firebase Remote Config, which may update them); the earbuds report their own band frequencies."
